    "standard-dialogue": [
      {
        "npc": "You offered yourself to Zulrah as a sacrifice, yet here you stand before me. Did Zulrah reject you?"
      },
      {
        "type": "choice",
        "options": [
          {
            "text": "I kinda left the shrine.",
            "condition": "If the player has visited the shrine but not killed Zulrah:",
            "steps": [
              {
                "player": "I kinda left the shrine."
              },
              {
                "npc": "Perhaps you should try offering yourself again, before the mighty Zulrah grows impatient."
              },
              {
                "type": "jump",
                "reference": "other",
                "id": "ord-1i"
              }
            ],
            "id": "4Hbiqn"
          },
          {
            "text": "I killed Zulrah.",
            "condition": "If the player has killed Zulrah:",
            "steps": [
              {
                "player": "I killed Zulrah."
              },
              {
                "npc": "Very funny, human, but I find that hard to believe. Go and offer yourself as a sacrifice again, before the mighty Zulrah grows impatient."
              },
              {
                "type": "jump",
                "reference": "other",
                "id": "BX3Ivs"
              }
            ],
            "id": "VGftnf"
          },
          {
            "text": "Have you any advice for surviving against Zulrah?",
            "steps": [
              {
                "player": "Have you any advice for surviving against Zulrah?"
              },
              {
                "npc": "I think you have misunderstood the nature of the sacrifice, human. Never mind, the mighty Zulrah will make the matter clear to you."
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "Tell me about Zulrah.",
            "steps": [
              {
                "player": "Tell me about Zulrah."
              },
              {
                "npc": "Zulrah is the all-powerful snake god of the southern wastes. He rises from the swamp to show his divine majesty and to accept our homage."
              },
              {
                "npc": "Long ago, our forebears came to this place, not realising that they were trespassing in Zulrah's domain. He arose from the swamp in wrath, and many were slain."
              },
              {
                "npc": "But Zulrah, in his mercy, allowed some of those transgressors to live, sparing them the punishment they deserved, and allowing them the chance to repent."
              },
              {
                "npc": "Then my mother, oldest and wisest of the tribe, dared to intercede with the mighty Zulrah on behalf of her people, and thus a sacred contract was declared."
              },
              {
                "npc": "Zulrah granted us the right to dwell in his lands, and to eat of their bounty. None shall ever drive us out, for Zulrah protects us."
              },
              {
                "npc": "All he asks in return is a periodic sacrifice at his sacred shrine. As long as the sacrifices continue, Zulrah will let us live peacefully in his lands."
              },
              {
                "npc": "Willing volunteers are never hard to find, for their sacrifice buys peace for the tribe, and I grant their families extra rations of food."
              },
              {
                "type": "choice",
                "options": [
                  {
                    "text": "Have you any advice for surviving against Zulrah?",
                    "steps": [
                      {
                        "type": "jump",
                        "reference": "above",
                        "id": "X5VSfw"
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "Who are you all?",
                    "steps": [
                      {
                        "type": "jump",
                        "reference": "below",
                        "id": "AF4Odt"
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "I'm off.",
                    "steps": [
                      {
                        "type": "jump",
                        "reference": "below",
                        "id": "OWqX7n"
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "Who are you all?",
            "steps": [
              {
                "player": "Who are you all?"
              },
              {
                "npc": "The southern wastes are a perilous place where travellers often become lost. Elves from the woodland villages, gnomes from the eastern caves, and many others."
              },
              {
                "npc": "Some find their way here, like my forebears did. They eat of the sacred swamp eels that Zulrah sends, and become one with the tribe."
              },
              {
                "npc": "Their original families and tribes shun them as unclean creatures once they have tasted of the sacred swamp eels, so they remain here to worship Zulrah."
              },
              {
                "type": "choice",
                "options": [
                  {
